{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/981b178e5b0cb2480a8f9e3cc9d156a2.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wonderful Handhelds</strong> is a game that allows you to collect and play fictional retro LCD games, inspired by classic devices from the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/1aea9e265f9e22507316f61a76b28fdf.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a dad making games under the name of <strong>Dad's Indie Studio</strong>. I'm also an avid collector of retro devices, especially Game&amp;Watch and Tiger Electronics, along with other lesser-known brands and models. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a way to share my passion for collecting and playing video games in their simplest and purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f8cbb0f5fd7802b4e802c192c936c9d8.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/7f2e622e945036352a1de39e661d45c2.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this early access release, you'll explore <strong>Cursed Castle</strong>, the first of three planned handheld games. This game pays homage to classic dungeon adventures with spooky skeletons, locked doors, and hidden keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/dc2555c8f47a156fd380f36675d7e9dd.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the demo where &quot;your friend&quot; lends you the first handheld game, Cursed Castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play through the entire game and complete it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that in the full version, you\u2019ll <strong>gain access to additional features</strong> such as score saving, the game manual, and the box, <strong>along with two more games</strong> to explore in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b91711efb03564bbe6ceffd56fb8f765.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonderful Handhelds is a <strong>truly indie game</strong> I\u2019m developing in my spare time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Wishlists</strong> and <strong>Support</strong> during early access will help fund the project and bring Wonderful Handhelds to life. Join the adventure and be part of the game's development journey!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Die for the first time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3079720/3876973a61f284c15e9087b8f43ce0da13c09b81.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3079720/034d7627ff897b673a6d9a3e6618bf8bcebf2bb8.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the game without using the shield","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3079720/8eca167c747eccc2fd4784ed3700a29c74c3e8ec.jpg"},{"name":"Discover the secret room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3079720/244a2f2f25eac87025da85f58d5793f54b001999.jpg"},{"name":"Reach the maximum score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3079720/b195a33ce55891e0a17a495fde523f53c5508560.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3079720?t=1764329921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/9b195648055cfd3e1a324972767d923abb16c337/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764329921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/21b7b5d51ec4c27dcc5e7004583f83923b0587b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764329921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/21b7b5d51ec4c27dcc5e7004583f83923b0587b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764329921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3193890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/981b178e5b0cb2480a8f9e3cc9d156a2.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wonderful Handhelds</strong> is a game that allows you to collect and play fictional retro LCD games, inspired by classic devices from the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/a70f108971f648ee5233f8828d09d8a8.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/1aea9e265f9e22507316f61a76b28fdf.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a dad making games under the name of <strong>Dad's Indie Studio</strong>. I'm also an avid collector of retro devices, especially Game&amp;Watch and Tiger Electronics, along with other lesser-known brands and models. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a way to share my passion for collecting and playing video games in their simplest and purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f8cbb0f5fd7802b4e802c192c936c9d8.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/7f2e622e945036352a1de39e661d45c2.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this early access release, you'll explore <strong>Cursed Castle</strong>, the first of three planned handheld games. This game pays homage to classic dungeon adventures with spooky skeletons, locked doors, and hidden keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5459c56cce4399c467691389f9652160.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b90568f89e0d720672e8040593f6d769.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/5383196b0c9683bdf0d2387f5ce9211b.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.poster.avif?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.webm?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/f921f73b9f4c43d321330c6b18c10b20.mp4?t=1764329921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/dc2555c8f47a156fd380f36675d7e9dd.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the demo where &quot;your friend&quot; lends you the first handheld game, Cursed Castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play through the entire game and complete it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that in the full version, you\u2019ll <strong>gain access to additional features</strong> such as score saving, the game manual, and the box, <strong>along with two more games</strong> to explore in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/extras/b91711efb03564bbe6ceffd56fb8f765.webp?t=1764329921\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonderful Handhelds is a <strong>truly indie game</strong> I\u2019m developing in my spare time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Wishlists</strong> and <strong>Support</strong> during early access will help fund the project and bring Wonderful Handhelds to life. Join the adventure and be part of the game's development journey!</p>","developers":["Dad's Indie Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079720/3129ae88db93486dce47db07f1f427fff1821ff4/header.jpg?t=1764329921","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Dad's Indie Studio, all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com